OL,3,GNEWSAVillage team triumphs in FA Cup
OL,4,Arow replay
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe victory brings with it #3,375 from
OL,7,Fthe FA Cup prize fund and a home tie
OL,8,Fagainst Gloucester City in the third
OL,9,Fqualifying round of the world's oldest
OL,10,Ffootball competition.
